# Font stylesheets are machine output, and there are 8837 lines of them against a few hundred
# lines of CSS anybody wrote. Left counted, the language statistics describe the subsetter rather
# than the repository.
#
# A glob rather than a list of families: adding a font is three steps and coming back here is not
# one anybody would remember. Nothing in this directory is hand-authored -- every file is
# @font-face rules and unicode-ranges, whether `mise run fonts` produced them or they arrived in a
# prebuilt web package. See spec/architecture.md.
#
# Every other stylesheet stays counted. `libs/tokens/src/colors.css`, `apps/site/src/styles/` and
# the rest are decisions somebody made and should weigh what they weigh.
libs/fonts/src/*.css linguist-generated=true

# Written by `cms image`, and tracked only because a build resolves every image from it
# without a byte of data/ present. It is a record, not source.
data/metadata.json linguist-generated=true
